    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1111" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωνο-θετέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exhibit games</i>, <i><span class="en">
